<title>USA: Redwood Trust sets first quarter dividend.</title>
<headline>Redwood Trust sets first quarter dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MILL VALLEY, Calif. 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Redwood Trust Inc said its board of directors declared a first quarter dividend of $0.60 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable April 21 to shareholders of record March 31.</p>
</text>
